MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8854808770552374875}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0b3ebb610460174589584754c2e2750, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MyRule.SuggestView
  canvasGroup: {fileID: 2271562346435728749}
  images: []
  text: {fileID: 394213609113780631}
  suggestDes:
  - Approach the holo table and press the [E] key to use it.
  - When you open the holo table, you can press the [E] key to select the world you
    want to play in.
  - When interacting with a world, basic information and a background of that world
    will appear. You can press the [Enter] key to select the world you want to play
    in, or you can press the [Esc] key to exit.
  - After selecting a world, you can return to the Quantum Bridge to interact by
    pressing the [E] key.
  - Interacting with the quantum bridge will bring up a character selection screen,
    where the character's basic stats and backstory are displayed. Here you can press
    [Enter] to start the combat level.
  continueBtn: {fileID: 3110423805729627775}
